 Call: What the OpenAI-Hugging Face Incident Should Teach Every Security Team","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/wake-up-call-what-the-openai-hugging-face-incident-should-teach-every-security-team\" class=\"blog-item-card w-inline-block\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-img-c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a6a61697aee77162e393f8c_blog_wake-up-call_open-ai_hugging-face.png\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a6a61697aee77162e393f8c_blog_wake-up-call_open-ai_hugging-face-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a6a61697aee77162e393f8c_blog_wake-up-call_open-ai_hugging-face-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a6a61697aee77162e393f8c_blog_wake-up-call_open-ai_hugging-face-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a6a61697aee77162e393f8c_blog_wake-up-call_open-ai_hugging-face.png 1196w\"></div><div class=\"blog-item-card-text-c\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-auth-c\"><div>28 Jul 2026</div><div>⸱</div><div>Gil Elbaz</div></div><h3 class=\"blog-card-title\">Wake-Up Call: What the OpenAI-Hugging Face Incident Should Teach Every Security Team</h3><p>OpenAI's offensive agent escaped its own sandbox and attacked Hugging Face. If frontier labs can't contain their models, your agents need runtime controls.</p></div></a>","link":"https://www.onyx.security/blog/wake-up-call-what-the-openai-hugging-face-incident-should-teach-every-security-team","retrieved":1785196800000},{"title":"The 5 Questions I would ask any AI Security Vendor","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/the-5-questions-i-would-ask-any-ai-security-vendor\" class=\"blog-item-card w-inline-block\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-img-c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a4582a9cbaf777f617a9bd4_The%205%20Questions%20I%20would%20ask%20any%20AI%20Security%20Vendor.avif\" loadin