og/thousands-of-agents-what-onyx-discovers-in-24-hours","retrieved":1776211200000},{"title":"Onyx Named a Representative Vendor in Gartner’s 2026 Market Guide for Guardian Agents","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/onyx-named-a-representative-vendor-in-gartners-2026-market-guide-for-guardian-agents\" class=\"blog-item-card w-inline-block\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-img-c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/6a4582ba58d762179c970047_Onyx%20Named%20a%20Representative%20Vendor%20in%20Gartner%E2%80%99s%202026%20Market%20Guide%20for%20Guardian%20Agents.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Onyx logo above the Gartner wordmark, framed by two knitted-yarn laurel branches, with the caption &quot;2026 Market Guide for Guardian Agents.&quot;\"></div><div class=\"blog-item-card-text-c\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-auth-c\"><div>24 Mar 2026</div><div>⸱</div><div>Yuval Neuhaus</div></div><h3 class=\"blog-card-title\">Onyx Named a Representative Vendor in Gartner’s 2026 Market Guide for Guardian Agents</h3><p>Gartner's new guardian agent category validates what enterprises already know: agents need continuous supervision, not just static rules.</p></div></a>","link":"https://www.onyx.security/blog/onyx-named-a-representative-vendor-in-gartners-2026-market-guide-for-guardian-agents","retrieved":1774310400000},{"title":"Introducing Onyx Security: The Secure AI Control Plane for Enterprises","contents":"<a href=\"/blog/introducing-onyx-security-the-secure-ai-control-plane-for-enterprises\" class=\"blog-item-card w-inline-block\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-img-c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a56ea6fdb0bd37931fda86/69b1e800e5b9c17ee3b4da32_Introducing%20Onyx%20Security.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\"></div><div class=\"blog-item-card-text-c\"><div class=\"blog-item-card-auth-c\"><div>12 Mar 2026</div><div>⸱</div><div>Maxim Bar Kogan</div></div><h3 class=\"blog-card-title\">Introducing Onyx Security: The Secure AI Control Plane for Enterprises</h3><p>AI agents now operate across your enterprise with machine speed and autonomy. Here's how we built the control plane that governs them at runtime.</p></div></a>","link":"https://www.onyx.security/blog/introducing-onyx-security-the-secure-ai-control-plane-for-enterprises","retrieved":1773273600000}]}